{"metadata":{"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"范畴论","text":"范畴论"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"余完备化"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5],"title":[{"Plain":"余完备化"},2]},"content":{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>设 $K\\subset R$ 是两族小范畴 (即 $K\\hookrightarrow R \\hookrightarrow\\mathsf{Cat}$ 为全子范畴). 对于具有 $R$-形余极限的范畴 $\\mathcal C$, 可在保持 $R$-形余极限的条件下, “自由地添加 $K$-形余极限”, 得到\n$$\r\n\\mathcal C \\hookrightarrow \\mathsf{P}_{R}^K(\\mathcal C).\r\n$$</p>\n"}}